# Trezor

> Trezor is the original hardware wallet, created by SatoshiLabs in 2013. Trezor hardware wallets keep private keys offline in a secure device, giving people true self-custody of Bitcoin, Ethereum, and thousands of other cryptocurrencies. trezor.io is the official website where you can buy Trezor devices and accessories, manage your crypto with the Trezor Suite app, and learn how to use self-custody securely.

All links below point to canonical pages on https://trezor.io. Content is available in multiple languages via locale-prefixed paths (e.g. https://trezor.io/de/...); the unprefixed URLs serve English.

